// ============================================================================
// CVARINFO.ipc - UHADD <-> UHADDR argument staging / database cvars.
// (NOT settings: ACS has no string parameters across libraries, so UHADD
//  writes these and the matching UHADDR handler reads them.)
//
// Every name below must stay registered even when unused: an unregistered name
// would land in the dynamic-cvar pool and collide with other ACS-created cvars
// (e.g. MMSP bot names).  Add a new stager to its owning block.
// ============================================================================

// DefineBoss IPC
